on: its source, its rank in the source’s row, and its target. Equality,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order and hashing use ","type":"text"},{"code":"(source, rank)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; the target is a function of them under the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"closure’s determinism law, and is carried so that reading it calls nothing.","type":"text"}]}}}